# Port patch (branch feature/offline-randomizer): the offline randomizer's decoded room sidecar.
# A room archive (files/StN/rNNN.das) is Yz2, an adaptive arithmetic coder (game/yz2code.cpp, yz2asm.cpp),
# so a patcher cannot rebuild one offline. Instead the decoded archive is written into the app's own folder
# randomizer/stN/rNNN.das.raw (the app's native room decoder, NativeBridge.decodeRoom) and decodeData loads
# it in place of the decoder's output (runtime/room_raw.cpp). Allocating and filling there keeps the vanilla
# path's heap bookkeeping, its out_data_size and its iTask; only the decode itself is skipped. The sidecar is
# used only when it starts like a room archive (re4_room_raw_looks_like_room); otherwise, and when it is
# missing or unreadable, Yz2DecodeExec runs and the disc is played as it is — a wrong sidecar cannot crash.
--- a/src/game/read.cpp
