+    /* port (patch 0238): a room the offline randomizer patched carries its decoded archive beside the .das
+       (runtime/room_raw.cpp); that archive is the room, so its size is what is allocated here instead of the
+       decoder's. The heap is the same, the iTask is the same, and a missing or unreadable sidecar falls back to
